WEBVTT

00:00:00.843 --> 00:00:03.706
This is the story of Hapu.

00:00:03.766 --> 00:00:09.991
He lives in Ancient Egypt at the time of Queen Cleopatra.

00:00:10.051 --> 00:00:14.695
His father, Bak, has a small factory.

00:00:14.755 --> 00:00:18.498
He makes gold tables and chairs.

00:00:18.558 --> 00:00:21.360
Hapu helps him.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.523
He is a 'fireboy'.

00:00:24.583 --> 00:00:29.899
Every day he pushes a long handle up and down.

00:00:29.959 --> 00:00:34.004
The work is hot and very hard.

00:00:34.064 --> 00:00:37.987
But what can he and his father do?

00:00:38.047 --> 00:00:40.610
They are poor people.

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:43.852
They need to make money.

00:00:43.912 --> 00:00:48.946
Every evening they sit beside the Nile.

00:00:49.006 --> 00:00:52.719
Bak talks to his son about the factory,

00:00:52.779 --> 00:00:54.590
tomorrow's work –

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:56.602
everything.

00:00:56.662 --> 00:01:00.132
“One day we’re going to be very rich,”

00:01:00.192 --> 00:01:02.080
he tells Hapu.

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:04.012
“Are we?”

00:01:04.072 --> 00:01:08.604
The fireboy looks into his father's tired eyes.

00:01:08.664 --> 00:01:10.675
“Yes.”

00:01:10.734 --> 00:01:13.006
Bak smiles.

00:01:13.066 --> 00:01:16.848
“I don’t know how and I don’t know when,

00:01:16.908 --> 00:01:18.899
but we are.”

00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:21.490
Then he stands up.

00:01:21.550 --> 00:01:24.050
“Come on,” he says.

00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:25.752
“It’s late.

00:01:25.812 --> 00:01:29.162
Let’s go home.”

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:36.303
Three days later Hapu and Bak are making a table.

00:01:36.363 --> 00:01:39.344
It's very hot in the room.

00:01:39.404 --> 00:01:43.614
Suddenly Bak stops work.

00:01:43.674 --> 00:01:45.505
“What is it, father?”

00:01:45.525 --> 00:01:49.876
Hapu asks. “Is something wrong?”

00:01:49.936 --> 00:01:52.306
“I don’t know,”

00:01:52.366 --> 00:01:54.157
Bak answers.

00:01:54.217 --> 00:01:56.867
He closes his eyes.

00:01:56.927 --> 00:02:00.745
“It’s my head. I can’t...”

00:02:00.805 --> 00:02:06.435
And then he falls on the ground.

00:02:06.495 --> 00:02:08.997
“Father!”

00:02:09.057 --> 00:02:14.142
Hapu runs to Bak and puts one hand under his head.

00:02:14.201 --> 00:02:18.294
“Father – are you all right?”

00:02:18.354 --> 00:02:23.139
The next day Bak stays in bed.

00:02:23.198 --> 00:02:26.360
“I’m sorry, Hapu,” he says.

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:29.444
“I want to work but I can’t.

00:02:29.504 --> 00:02:31.417
I’m ill.”

00:02:31.477 --> 00:02:34.932
Hapu is very sad.

00:02:34.992 --> 00:02:38.793
“Father works too hard,” he thinks.

00:02:38.853 --> 00:02:41.234
“That’s why he’s ill.

00:02:41.294 --> 00:02:43.616
We need more money –

00:02:43.676 --> 00:02:47.146
but what can I do?”

00:02:47.206 --> 00:02:50.898
Then he has an idea.

00:02:50.958 --> 00:02:54.240
“Of course!” he thinks.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:59.032
“I must make something for somebody very rich.

00:02:59.092 --> 00:03:03.064
Somebody like ... the Queen!”

00:03:03.124 --> 00:03:07.135
Bak is ill for two weeks.

00:03:07.195 --> 00:03:12.946
In that time, Hapu makes a lot of tables and chairs.

00:03:13.006 --> 00:03:16.527
But not only tables and chairs.

00:03:16.587 --> 00:03:20.318
He makes a gold necklace, too.

00:03:20.378 --> 00:03:24.978
“There!” he thinks late one night.

00:03:25.038 --> 00:03:27.049
“It’s ready.”

00:03:27.109 --> 00:03:29.290
He smiles.

00:03:29.349 --> 00:03:32.574
The necklace is very beautiful.

00:03:32.634 --> 00:03:37.938
“Queen Cleopatra is going to like this,” Hapu thinks.

00:03:37.998 --> 00:03:42.088
“She’s going to pay a lot of money for it, too.

00:03:42.148 --> 00:03:44.149
I know she is.”

00:03:44.209 --> 00:03:48.990
The next morning he goes to Cleopatra's palace.

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:53.811
The necklace is in a bag under his shirt.

00:03:53.871 --> 00:03:56.311
“What do you want?”

00:03:56.371 --> 00:03:58.772
asks a palace guard.

00:03:58.832 --> 00:04:01.378
There are two guards.

00:04:01.438 --> 00:04:06.337
Each one has a sword.

00:04:06.357 --> 00:04:07.958
“I want to see the Queen,”

00:04:07.978 --> 00:04:10.538
Hapu answers.

00:04:10.598 --> 00:04:13.220
Both guards laugh.

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:15.591
“Go home, boy,”

00:04:15.651 --> 00:04:17.262
says one of them.

00:04:17.322 --> 00:04:20.223
“Queen Cleopatra doesn’t see people like you.”

00:04:20.243 --> 00:04:24.786
Hapu is very unhappy.

00:04:24.845 --> 00:04:27.177
“What do I do now?”

00:04:27.236 --> 00:04:28.828
he thinks.

00:04:28.888 --> 00:04:33.410
He leaves the palace and begins to walk home.

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:38.932
But ten minutes later, he passes two men in the market.

00:04:38.992 --> 00:04:45.075
“Cleopatra’s women are coming here tomorrow morning,” says one.

00:04:45.135 --> 00:04:47.766
“They’re arriving very early.

00:04:47.826 --> 00:04:52.138
They want to buy lots of new clothes for her.”

00:04:52.198 --> 00:04:57.200
“That’s very good news,” Hapu thinks.

00:04:57.260 --> 00:05:02.677
The next day the fireboy gets up very early.

00:05:02.736 --> 00:05:06.488
He makes a cup of sweet tea for Bak.

00:05:06.548 --> 00:05:09.920
Then he goes to the market.

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:15.372
“I can give the necklace to Cleopatra’s women,” he thinks.

00:05:15.432 --> 00:05:19.364
“They can give it to the Queen for me.”

00:05:19.424 --> 00:05:23.546
He waits and waits.

00:05:23.606 --> 00:05:28.644
For a long time nothing happens.

00:05:28.704 --> 00:05:32.544
Then music starts to play.

00:05:32.604 --> 00:05:38.736
A moment later, Hapu sees a long line of people.

00:05:38.796 --> 00:05:44.939
They are coming from the palace.

00:05:44.998 --> 00:05:53.042
Four men are carrying a very beautiful chair.

00:05:53.102 --> 00:05:56.437
A woman is sitting in it.

00:05:56.497 --> 00:06:00.782
Hapu puts one hand across his eyes.

00:06:00.842 --> 00:06:04.653
“It’s the Queen!” he thinks.

00:06:04.712 --> 00:06:07.874
“She’s coming, too!”

00:06:07.934 --> 00:06:13.694
A minute later, Cleopatra arrives.

00:06:13.754 --> 00:06:18.666
Suddenly everyone is very quiet.

00:06:18.726 --> 00:06:24.625
Then Hapu thinks, “This is the moment.”

00:06:24.685 --> 00:06:28.864
He runs in front of Cleopatra's chair.

00:06:28.924 --> 00:06:31.676
“Stop!” he says.

00:06:31.736 --> 00:06:34.308
“Please. Stop!”

00:06:34.367 --> 00:06:37.460
The Queen looks at him.

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:40.100
“What do you want?”

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:41.952
she asks.

00:06:42.012 --> 00:06:45.844
Hapu gives her the necklace.

00:06:45.904 --> 00:06:49.786
“Is this really your work?”

00:06:49.845 --> 00:06:52.196
asks Cleopatra.

00:06:52.256 --> 00:06:55.302
“Yes, yes it is,”

00:06:55.362 --> 00:06:57.458
Hapu answers.

00:06:57.518 --> 00:07:04.470
“Guards!” says Cleopatra. “Give this boy some money.”

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:08.412
She holds the necklace in her hands.

00:07:08.472 --> 00:07:12.754
“This is beautiful,” she says.

00:07:12.814 --> 00:07:16.054
Then she leaves.

00:07:16.114 --> 00:07:19.166
Hapu runs home.

00:07:19.225 --> 00:07:23.087
He is very, very happy.

00:07:23.147 --> 00:07:26.062
Bak is in bed.

00:07:26.122 --> 00:07:29.358
“Look!” Hapu says.

00:07:29.418 --> 00:07:35.183
He shows the money from Cleopatra's necklace to his father.

00:07:35.243 --> 00:07:38.205
“But how...?”

00:07:38.265 --> 00:07:44.010
Bak closes his eyes, then opens them again.

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:48.833
“I don’t understand,” he says.

00:07:48.892 --> 00:07:51.694
Hapu smiles.

00:07:51.754 --> 00:07:57.366
He sits down and tells his father everything.

00:07:57.426 --> 00:08:05.328
At the end of the story Bak says, “You’re a good son, Hapu.

00:08:05.388 --> 00:08:07.350
Thank you.”

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:12.673
That night Hapu looks up at the stars.

00:08:12.733 --> 00:08:18.398
“Now I can pay for a doctor to visit father,” he thinks.

00:08:18.458 --> 00:08:22.770
“Then, after father is strong again...”

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:27.018
But at that moment, he stops.

00:08:27.078 --> 00:08:32.475
One of Cleopatra's guards is standing in front of him.

00:08:32.534 --> 00:08:35.527
He has a big sword.

00:08:35.586 --> 00:08:39.629
“Are you Hapu, son of Bak?”

00:08:39.688 --> 00:08:41.710
he asks.

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:44.502
Hapu looks at him.

00:08:44.562 --> 00:08:46.242
“Yes.

00:08:46.302 --> 00:08:47.853
Yes, I am,”

00:08:47.913 --> 00:08:49.904
he answers.

00:08:49.964 --> 00:08:53.936
“Come with me,” says the guard.

00:08:53.996 --> 00:08:57.776
“Queen Cleopatra likes your work.

00:08:57.836 --> 00:09:02.147
She wants to give you a job at the palace.”

00:09:02.206 --> 00:09:04.998
“But I have a job,”

00:09:05.058 --> 00:09:06.898
Hapu says.

00:09:06.958 --> 00:09:09.770
“I work with my father.

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:12.190
I can’t leave him.

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:14.701
You don’t underst...”

00:09:14.761 --> 00:09:16.472
“No.

00:09:16.531 --> 00:09:19.093
You don’t understand,”

00:09:19.153 --> 00:09:20.974
the guard says.

00:09:21.034 --> 00:09:26.392
“When the Queen gives you a job, you take it.”

00:09:26.452 --> 00:09:30.092
He puts one hand on his sword.

00:09:30.152 --> 00:09:35.416
“Now go and say goodbye to your father.”

00:09:35.476 --> 00:09:40.800
At the palace, Cleopatra talks to Hapu.

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:43.552
She is wearing his necklace.

00:09:43.613 --> 00:09:51.668
“I want you to live here and make lots of beautiful things for me,” she says.

00:09:51.728 --> 00:09:56.842
“Thank you, Queen of the Nile,” Hapu says.

00:09:56.902 --> 00:10:02.484
“But...” “But?” The Queen looks at Hapu.

00:10:02.544 --> 00:10:06.656
“But ... I can’t live here.

00:10:06.716 --> 00:10:16.028
You see, my father is very ill and...” Hapu tells the Queen everything.

00:10:16.088 --> 00:10:22.281
At the end of Hapu's story, Cleopatra looks at him.

00:10:22.341 --> 00:10:25.408
“All right,” she says.

00:10:25.468 --> 00:10:28.316
“You can go home to your father.

00:10:28.376 --> 00:10:33.678
But...” “But?” asks Hapu.

00:10:33.738 --> 00:10:40.091
“But from today, the two of you work only for me.

00:10:40.151 --> 00:10:41.932
Do you understand?”

00:10:41.952 --> 00:10:47.044
“Oh yes!” Hapu smiles.

00:10:47.103 --> 00:10:49.524
He is very happy.

00:10:49.584 --> 00:10:55.552
Now he and his father can make lots of beautiful things

00:10:55.613 --> 00:10:58.293
and be rich.

00:10:58.353 --> 00:11:01.943
“Yes, I understand.”